{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 在 S08、S11、S12 等短时段塞入的感受信息偏密，观众可能来不及兼顾音乐和文字；X 在扫读效率上更好。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的优势不只是信息更多，而是把人物的心理变化拆成了可以跟着音乐逐步经历的过程，重点句有明确强调，感受也能对应到具体音乐时刻。尤其从舍不得亲近、怀疑离开是否正确、害怕孤独，到最后允许自己同时承认委屈和幸福，前后的心理因果更完整，音乐情绪也更细腻具体。X 更容易快速扫读，但不少音乐变化和情绪转折被压缩成概括性短词，观众容易知道发生了什么，却少了一些亲自感受到它如何发生的过程。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3aa04ef0-71dc-48dd-90c6-424999def765", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T183119634054Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:32:34.541187+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2dcd649592fba0869e0e2da866a98fea45987942642ad98fd400d54e0f603715", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha